  "id": "self-consciousness",
  "term": "self-consciousness",
  "definition": "Self-consciousness is the capacity for conscious awareness of oneself, discussed in psychology and philosophy as a form of consciousness tied to the self. The packet indicates that many different theories try to explain where it comes from, ranging from bodily, cognitive, neural, social, and evolutionary accounts, but no single definition or explanation is universally accepted.",
